  "rocprofv3_invocation": "rocprofv3 --pmc MeanOccupancyPerActiveCU -d <dir> -o <tag> --output-format csv -- python AI/probe_rmsnorm_measured_occupancy.py --inner <m> <n,n,...>. The --output-format csv is load-bearing: the default output is a .db with rocpd_kernel_dispatch and no counter table.",
